OL,3,GNEWSAProperty, football and politics:
OL,4,AThe links between Manchester and Abu
OL,5,ADhabi explained
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Manchester City was found guilty
OL,8,Fin September of breaching Premier
OL,9,FLeague financial rules, the damning and
OL,10,Funprecedented verdict left the football
OL,11,Fworld reeling.
OL,13,FAn independent commission said the club
OL,14,Fhad "systematically" broken rules
OL,15,Fbetween 2009 and 2018 by inflating
OL,16,Fsponsorship revenue to disguise secret
OL,17,Ffunding of more than #830m into its
OL,18,Ffootball operations.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
