OL,3,GNEWSAProperty, football and politics:
OL,4,AThe links between Manchester and Abu
OL,5,ADhabi explained
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeculation is now rife about the level
OL,8,Fof punishment City will face, although
OL,9,Fthe club denies any wrongdoing and has
OL,10,Fappealed against the ruling.
OL,12,FWhile we await the outcome, the
OL,13,Fhistorical relationship between City's
OL,14,FAbu Dhabi-based owners and Manchester's
OL,15,Fpolitical elite - including the now
OL,16,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham - has been
OL,17,Fin the spotlight.
